ity from those interference sources. If all they're doing is interfering with our vision, then we can leave them be for now. Our priority is obtaining activation access to the quarantine walls. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, we'd best leave this city as soon as possible."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have a bad feeling about this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II, is that heavy fog still there?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm? Of course it is, and the sky's really dark too."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4A1 raises her head to look at the sky. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The heavens are bright and clear, completely unlike the tragic state of the land."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I understand."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You've been looking really thoughtful recently. Are you running out of neural cloud space?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, you're just imagining things. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Let's go. There's no point waiting here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M'kay— I heard some monsters just now, shall we go over and play with them?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure. And gunfire too... The Griffin team searching for the control center is probably being attacked by the enemy. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Comms are down, so the Commander's train won't enter the city for the time being. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Let's go back them up and make sure we have adequate fighting power."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Roger! In that case, RO and I will take the lead—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Are we abandoning the train station? The Commander ordered us to hold position..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not picking up any enemies in the region, so the train station is safe at the moment. As a special-duties unit, we ought to be more proactive."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood. I'll set up a few sensors to serve as intruder alarms. If there's any danger here, we'll pick it up right away."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, thank you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Brain","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(OGAS, can you analyze these external connections?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(I regret to say that I lack knowledge pertaining to these matters.) "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"(However, these connections are very much like me.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Are they part of you?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Certainly not. They are far from being worthy enough to become me.) "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"(They are like little things that show up when you are duplicating something. Even if there was a Doll made in your image, would you say that she was you?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(...So they're duplicates?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(They were probably made to imitate me or you, but they are of a very low quality. They do not even qualify as \"duplicates\". At the very most, they would be a kind of \"isomer\".)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Isomers...so are they Nytos?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(There is a signal source with an exceptionally large phase shift. It seems to be the core of all the signal sources. The signal is changing position by the second, as though it was shuttling between different bodies.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(I...don't quite get what you mean.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(There is a constantly-moving consciousness, shifting from one Doll to another, as though trying to access something. It is anxious and fearful, like a lost child.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(So is it a Nyto? Is it launching an electronic attack?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(No...it's not quite the same. This doesn't feel like an electronic attack, more like...some kind of search.) "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"(However, it has made countless connections, and it has taken over this city. I feel that it might possess the authorization you want. Would you like me to pinpoint its location?)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(There's no need for that.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(You are afraid. You are not prepared to accept the truth. You feel that things may not be as you expect.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Shut up!)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"197","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4...what's the matter with you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's nothing..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Really now... Then let me state my opinion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I think we should go and deal with the root of the problem and find the source of the intereference that's causing all this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We need to push forward, no matter what. We can make our decision once we have more information."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"159","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The AR Team advances to the position from where the gunfire came."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sneak","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rounds of this caliber... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"M4, Desert Eagle was here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There are bullet marks everywhere, and ELID corpses. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you see any other Griffin Dolls?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nope... All the enemies over here were wiped out. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But this scrap of cloth looks really familiar! It belongs to that person I ran into on the train..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me see... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Is this Desert Eagle's clothing? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AR-15, do you remember?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It looks like it, but rather than just going by that, why don't we look around the place... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Look, someone left a set of coordinates here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These coordinates are written in the same format as outlined in the contingency plan for if we lost contact with each other. It's from one of our Dolls. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The destination indicated by these coordinates isn't far away. We should go take a look."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I still think that we ought to prioritize dealing with those interference sources. The Griffin echelons can handle the enemies by themselves."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And what if the interference becomes strong enough to incapacitate our Dolls? We need to ensure our Dolls' safety."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4...are you afraid of whatever it is that's causing this disruption?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...If you're too timid to take action, we might lose the last chance we have to take a stand against the enemy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know, but right now...let's move on and find that Griffin echelon. We can't allow our friends to be lost, no matter who they are."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Acknowledged."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"46","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Inside the building."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"DesertEagle","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Reverse","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Desert Eagle","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"ACR, how many rounds do you have left?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"DesertEagle","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ACR","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ACR","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leader, I'm below 30% ammo!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"DesertEagle","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ACR","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Desert Eagle","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fall back to me. We'll retreat another floor up. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is the maximum safe height. If there's more of them, we might need to consider jumping down from here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"DesertEagle","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ACR","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Select","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"ACR","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is the first time I